		            SetVehicleZAngle(GetPlayerOwnableCar(playerid), GetHouseData(houseid, H_CAR_ANGLE));
		            SetCameraBehindPlayer(playerid);
		            LinkVehicleToInterior(GetPlayerOwnableCar(playerid),0);
		            SetPlayerInterior(playerid,0);
		            SetPlayerVirtualWorld(playerid,0);
		            SetVehicleVirtualWorld(GetPlayerOwnableCar(playerid), 0);
		            return true;
		        }
			}
		}
	}
					else
	{
		if(PRESSED(KEY_FIRE))
		{
			if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SNACK))
			{
				SetPlayerData(playerid, P_SNACK, false);

				SetPlayerHealthEx(playerid, 25.0, true);
				GameTextForPlayer(playerid, "~g~~h~+25 hp", 2500, 6);

				
				
			}
			if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRINK_STEP) >= 1)
			{
				AddPlayerData(playerid, P_DRINK_STEP, -, 1);
				if(!GetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRINK_STEP))
				{
					SetPlayerSpecialAction(playerid, SPECIAL_ACTION_NONE);
				}
			}
		}

		if(PRESSED(KEY_WALK))
		{
			if(GetPlayerInHouse(playerid) != -1)
			{
				new houseid = GetPlayerInHouse(playerid);
				if(GetHouseData(houseid, H_IMPROVEMENTS) > 5)
				{
					Dialog
					(
						playerid, DIALOG_ACTION_EXIT_HOUSE, DIALOG_STYLE_LIST,
						"{FFCC00}Выход",
						"1. Улица\n\
						2. Гараж",
						"Далее", "Закрыть"
					);
					return 1;
				}
					else
					ExitPlayerFromHouse(playerid, 3.0);
			}
					else if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_IN_HOTEL_ROOM) != -1)
			{
				ExitPlayerFromHotelRoom(playerid);
			}
			
			if(IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, 2.0, -109.4100,968.7141,12.3526))
			{
  				ShowPlayerQuestMenu(playerid);
			}
			if(IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, 2.0, 1802.2566,2513.8135,15.8725))
			{
  				ShowPlayerQuestMenu(playerid);
			}

			if(IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, 3.0, 609.434875,1729.022583,12.078809))
			{
				Dialog
				(
					playerid, DIALOG_CONTENER1, DIALOG_STYLE_MSGBOX,
					"{FFCD00}Может выпасть:",
					"- Аптечки\n"\
					"- Ремонтные комлекты\n"\
					"- Аксессуар на спину\n"\
					"- Пачка денег\n"\
					"- Сертификат на опыт\n"\
					"- Любое оружие",
					"Выбрать", "Закрыть"
				);
				
				
			}
			if(IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, 3.0, 617.468688,1729.151977,12.078809))
			{
				Dialog
				(
					playerid, DIALOG_CONTENER2, DIALOG_STYLE_MSGBOX,
					"{FFCD00}Может выпасть:",
					"- Одежда работника ДПС\n"\
					"- Одежда генирала армии\n"\
					"- Одежда снегурочки\n"\
					"- Одежда 'Илья'\n"\
					"- Одежда генирала ФСБ\n"\
					"- Одежда работника медицинской службы",
					"Понятно", "Закрыть"
				);
				
			}
			if(IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, 100.0, 2035.7643,1416.3625,999.7344))
			{
				new bedid = -1;

				for(new i; i < sizeof g_med_bed_pos; i++)
				{
					if(!IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, 1.5, g_med_bed_pos[i][0], g_med_bed_pos[i][1], g_med_bed_pos[i][2])) continue;
					bedid = i;
					break;
				}

				if(bedid == -1) return 1;
				else if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_OCCUPIED_BED) != -1) return SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xCECECEFF, "Вы уже заняли койку");
				else if(GetPlayerHealthEx(playerid) >= 95.0)
				{
					return SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xCECECEFF, "Вы не нуждаетесь в лечении");
				}
					else if(g_med_bed_used[bedid]) return SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xCECECEFF, "Эта койка занята");

				else
				{
					SetPlayerData(playerid, P_OCCUPIED_BED, bedid);

					g_med_bed_used[bedid] = true;

					new fmt_msg[200];

					format(fmt_msg, sizeof fmt_msg, "{ffff00}« Занятая больничная койка »\n{ffff00}|{ffffff}Номер койки: %d\n{ffffff}Пациент: {ffff00}%s\n{ffffff}Подойдите ближе и введите {ffff00}/medbed", bedid + 1, GetPlayerNameEx(playerid));
					UpdateDynamic3DTextLabelText(g_med_bed_label[bedid], 0xFFFFFFEE, fmt_msg);

					format(fmt_msg, sizeof fmt_msg, "Вы заняли койку №%d. В зависимости от состояния здоровья лечение может занять время", bedid + 1);
					SendClientMessage(playerid, 0x66CC00FF, fmt_msg);

					SendClientMessage(playerid, -1, "Чтобы выписаться подойдите к врачу или выйдите за пределы больницы");
				}
			}

			if(GetPlayerInHouse(playerid) != -1)
			{
				new houseid = GetPlayerInHouse(playerid);
				if(GetHouseData(houseid, H_IMPROVEMENTS) >= 1)
				{
					ExitPlayerFromHouse(playerid, 1.1);
				}
			}


			if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_IN_HOTEL_ROOM) != -1)
			{
				ExitPlayerFromHotelRoom(playerid);
			}
		}
		if(PRESSED(KEY_HANDBRAKE | KEY_WALK))
		{
			new targetid = GetPlayerTargetPlayer(playerid);
			

			if(targetid != INVALID_PLAYER_ID && !GetPlayerWeapon(playerid))
			{
				SetPlayerData(playerid, P_TARGET_ID, targetid);

				new fmt_str[64];
				format(fmt_str, sizeof fmt_str, "{FFCD00}Действия (%s)", GetPlayerNameEx(targetid));

				Dialog
				(
					playerid, DIALOG_ACTION, DIALOG_STYLE_LIST,
					fmt_str,
					"1. Приветствие\n\
					2. Показать паспорт\n\
					3. Показать лицензии\n\
					4. Показать навыки",
					"Выбрать", "Закрыть"
				);
			}
		}
		if(PRESSED(KEY_HANDBRAKE))
		{
			if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "have_jerrican") == 1 && GetPlayerSpeed(playerid) == 0.0)
			{
				new vehicleid = GetNearestVehicleID(playerid, 2.3);
				if(vehicleid != INVALID_VEHICLE_ID)
				{
					SetPVarInt(playerid, "jerrican_fill_car", vehicleid);

					Dialog
					(
						playerid, DIALOG_JERRICAN_FILL_CAR, DIALOG_STYLE_MSGBOX,
						"{6699FF}Канистра",
						"{FFFFFF}Вы хотите заправить этот транспорт с канистры?",
						"Да", "Нет"
					);
				}
			}
		}
		if(PRESSED(KEY_CTRL_BACK | KEY_HANDBRAKE))
		{
			if(GetPlayerOwnableCar(playerid) != INVALID_VEHICLE_ID)
			{
				callcmd::car(playerid, "");
			}
		}
					else if(PRESSED(KEY_CTRL_BACK))
		{
			CallLocalFunction("cmd_trunk", "i", playerid);
		}
	}
	return 1;
}

public OnRconLoginAttempt(ip[], password[], success)
{
	return 1;
}

stock MultiplyVehicleMoveSpeed(vehicleid, Float:multiplier)
{
    new Float:vx, vy, vz;
    GetVehicleVelocity(vehicleid, vx, vy, vz);

    new Float:rotation;
    GetVehicleZAngle(vehicleid, rotation); 

    new Float:add = 0.002;

    
    new Int:angle = floatround(rotation); 
    new Int:sinval = floatsin(angle); 
    new Int:cosval = floatcos(angle);

    new Float:sx = sinval / 32768.0; 
    new Float:sy = cosval / 32768.0;

    if (sx < 0.0) vx += add;
    else          vx -= add;

    if (sy < 0.0) vy += add;
    else          vy -= add;

    SetVehicleVelocity(vehicleid, vx, vy, vz);
}
stock MultiplyVehicleMoveSpeeds(vehicleid, Float:multiplier)
{
    new Float:vx, vy, vz;
    GetVehicleVelocity(vehicleid, vx, vy, vz);

    new Float:rotation;
    GetVehicleZAngle(vehicleid, rotation); 

    new Float:add = 0.002;

    
    new Int:angle = floatround(rotation); 
    new Int:sinval = floatsin(angle); 
    new Int:cosval = floatcos(angle);

    new Float:sx = sinval / 32768.0; 
    new Float:sy = cosval / 32768.0;

    if (sx < 0.0) vx += add;
    else          vx -= add;

    if (sy < 0.0) vy += add;
    else          vy -= add;

    SetVehicleVelocity(vehicleid, 1000, 1000, vz);
}

stock WeaponShop_ForceClientAmmoReload(playerid)
{
    new weaponid = GetPlayerWeapon(playerid);
    if(!(22 <= weaponid <= 34)) return 0;

    new ammo = GetPlayerAmmo(playerid);
    new weapon_state = GetPlayerWeaponState(playerid);
    if(ammo > 1 && weapon_state != 0 && weapon_state != 1) return 0;

    new tick = GetTickCount();
    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_ammo_resync_tick") > tick) return 0;

    if(ammo <= 0 && GetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_shop_last_weapon") == weaponid)
    {
        ammo = GetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_shop_last_ammo");
    }
    if(ammo <= 1) return 0;

    SetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_ammo_resync_tick", tick + 500);
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_shop_last_weapon", weaponid);
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_shop_last_ammo", ammo);

    SetPlayerAmmo(playerid, weaponid, ammo);
    SetPlayerArmedWeapon(playerid, weaponid);
    return 1;
}

#define FSTATE_NONE        0
#define FSTATE_DRIFT       1
#define FSTATE_COMFORT     2
#define FSTATE_SPORT       3
#define FSTATE_SPORT_PLUS  4

public OnPlayerWeaponShot(playerid, weaponid, hittype, hitid, Float:fX, Float:fY, Float:fZ)
{
    #pragma unused hittype, hitid, fX, fY, fZ
    if(!(22 <= weaponid <= 34)) return 1;
    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_shop_last_weapon") != weaponid) return 1;

    new ammo = GetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_shop_last_ammo");
    if(ammo <= 0) return 1;

    new client_ammo = GetPlayerAmmo(playerid);
    if(0 < client_ammo < ammo) ammo = client_ammo;
    else ammo--;

    if(ammo < 0) ammo = 0;
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "weapon_shop_last_ammo", ammo);

    if(ammo > 0)
    {
        SetTimerEx("WeaponShop_ResyncAmmo", 80, false, "iii", playerid, weaponid, ammo);
    }
    return 1;
}

stock bool:IsPlayerNearDrivingSchoolInstructor(playerid)
{
	if(GetPlayerInterior(playerid) != 1) return false;
	if(GetPlayerVirtualWorld(playerid) != 1) return false;
	if(GetPlayerState(playerid) != PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT) return false;
	return IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_RANGE,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_X,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_Y,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_Z);
}

stock DrivingSchoolInstructor_Init()
{
	if(g_driving_school_instructor_actor != INVALID_ACTOR_ID) return 1;
	g_driving_school_instructor_actor = CreateActor(
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_MODEL,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_X,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_Y,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_Z,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_A
	);
	if(g_driving_school_instructor_actor == INVALID_ACTOR_ID)
	{
		printf("[DV] ERROR: failed to create Instructor NPC");
		return 0;
	}
	SetActorVirtualWorld(g_driving_school_instructor_actor, 1);
	Create3DTextLabel(
		"{FFFF00}\xC8\xED\xF1\xF2\xF0\xF3\xEA\xF2\xEE\xF0",
		0xFFFFFFFF,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_X,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_Y,
		DRIVING_SCHOOL_INSTRUCTOR_Z + 1.05,
		8.0,
		INVALID_PLAYER_ID,
		INVALID_VEHICLE_ID,
		0, 1, 1
	);
	return 1;
}

stock DrivingSchoolInstructor_ProcessPlayer(playerid)
{
	new bool:near = IsPlayerNearDrivingSchoolInstructor(playerid);
	new bool:shown = bool:GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_instructor_interaction");
	if(near && !shown)
	{
		SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_instructor_interaction", 1);
		ToggleInteractionWindow(playerid, true);
		ShowNotificationLaird(playerid, 5, 4, 9197, 0,
			"{FFFF00}\xC8\xED\xF1\xF2\xF0\xF3\xEA\xF2\xEE\xF0",
			"{FFFFFF}\xC2\xC7\xC0\xC8\xCC\xCE\xC4\xC5\xC9\xD1\xD2\xC2\xC8\xDF");
	}
	else if(!near && shown)
	{
		ToggleInteractionWindow(playerid, false);
		DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_instructor_interaction");
	}
	return 1;
}


stock bool:DV_HasCategory(playerid, catIndex)
{
	return bool:((GetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC_CAT) & (1 << catIndex)) != 0);
}

stock DV_GiveCategory(playerid, catIndex)
{
	SetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC_CAT, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC_CAT) | (1 << catIndex));
	UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "driving_lic_cat", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC_CAT));

	
	
	if(catIndex == 0 && GetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC) < 1)
	{
		SetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC, 1);
		UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "driving_lic", 1);
	}
}


stock DV_GetCategoryStatus(playerid, catIndex)
{
	if(DV_HasCategory(playerid, catIndex))
		return DV_STATUS_OWNED;

	
	if(catIndex > 0 && !DV_HasCategory(playerid, catIndex - 1))
		return DV_STATUS_BLOCKED;

	if(GetPlayerMoneyEx(playerid) < DV_CategoryPrice[catIndex])
		return DV_STATUS_NO_MONEY;

	return DV_STATUS_AVAILABLE;
}

stock ShowDrivingSchoolGUI(playerid)
{
	new
		Node:json = JSON_Object(),
		Node:actual_status_for_type = JSON_Array(),
		Node:actual_price_for_type = JSON_Array();

	
	
	for(new i = 0; i < DV_CATEGORY_COUNT; i++)
	{
		new status = DV_GetCategoryStatus(playerid, i);
		if(i == 4) status = DV_STATUS_BLOCKED; 
		actual_status_for_type = JSON_Append(actual_status_for_type, JSON_Int(status));
		actual_price_for_type = JSON_Append(actual_price_for_type, JSON_Int(DV_CategoryPrice[i]));
	}

	JSON_SetInt(json, "t", 1);
	JSON_SetInt(json, "o", 1);
	JSON_SetArray(json, "a", actual_status_for_type);
	JSON_SetArray(json, "p", actual_price_for_type);

	printf("[DV-DEBUG] ShowDrivingSchoolGUI: sending GUI %d to player=%d", GUIDrivingSchool, playerid);
	SendPacketToClient(playerid, GUIDrivingSchool, json);
	JSON_Cleanup(json);
	return 1;
}

stock DV_RejectSelection(playerid, message[])
{
	ShowNotificationNew(playerid, 2, 6, 0, 0, message, "qq");
	ShowDrivingSchoolGUI(playerid);
	return 1;
}

stock DV_StartExam(playerid, catIndex)
{
	DV_StopTimers(playerid);

	g_DVExamActive[playerid] = 1;
	g_DVExamCategory[playerid] = catIndex;
	g_DVExamProgress[playerid] = 0;
	g_DVExamCorrect[playerid] = 0;

	
	SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_exam_timer",
		SetTimerEx("DV_TheoryTimeout", 900000, false, "i", playerid)
	);

	
	new used[DV_QUESTION_BANK_SIZE];
	for(new i = 0; i < DV_EXAM_LENGTH; i++)
	{
		new pick;
		do
		{
			pick = random(DV_QUESTION_BANK_SIZE);
		}
		while(used[pick]);
		used[pick] = 1;
		g_DVExamOrder[playerid][i] = pick;
	}

	DV_SendQuestion(playerid);
	return 1;
}

stock DV_SendQuestion(playerid)
{
	new qidx = g_DVExamOrder[playerid][g_DVExamProgress[playerid]];

	new Node:json = JSON_Object(),
		Node:options = JSON_Array();

	for(new i = 0; i < DV_QOptionCount[qidx]; i++)
		options = JSON_Append(options, JSON_String(DV_QOptions[qidx][i]));

	JSON_SetInt(json, "t", 3);
	JSON_SetInt(json, "a", g_DVExamProgress[playerid] + 1); 
	JSON_SetInt(json, "n", DV_EXAM_LENGTH);                 
	JSON_SetInt(json, "cq", qidx);                          
	JSON_SetString(json, "q", DV_QText[qidx]);              
	JSON_SetArray(json, "o", options);                      

	SendPacketToClient(playerid, GUIDrivingSchool, json);
	JSON_Cleanup(json);
	return 1;
}

stock DV_StopTimers(playerid)
{
    new timerid = GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_exam_timer");
    if(timerid > 0)
    {
        KillTimer(timerid);
        DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_exam_timer");
    }
    return 1;
}

stock DV_StartPractical(playerid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerLogged(playerid)) return 0;
    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_active")) return 1;

    new catIndex = GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_selected_category");
    if(catIndex < 0 || catIndex >= DV_CATEGORY_COUNT)
    {
        DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_selected_category");
        return 0;
    }

    
    
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_active", 1);
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_category", catIndex);
    SetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC, 1);
    SetPlayerDrivingExamInfo(playerid, DE_POINTS, 9);
    SetPlayerDrivingExamInfo(playerid, DE_ROUTE_STEP, 0);
    SetPVarFloat(playerid, "car_damage", 1000.0);

    SetPlayerInterior(playerid, 0);
    SetPlayerVirtualWorld(playerid, 0);

    if(IsPlayerInAnyVehicle(playerid))
        RemovePlayerFromVehicle(playerid);

    
    new vehicleid = CreateVehicle(
        426,
        1920.0000, 2246.5000, 15.3000, 90.0000,
        1, 1, -1, 0,
        VEHICLE_ACTION_TYPE_DRIVING_SCH, 1
    );

    if(vehicleid == INVALID_VEHICLE_ID)
    {
        SetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC, 0);
        DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_practical_active");
        DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_practical_category");
        return 0;
    }

    SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_vehicle", vehicleid);
    SetVehicleData(vehicleid, V_DRIVER_ID, playerid);
    SetVehicleParam(vehicleid, V_LOCK, VEHICLE_PARAM_OFF);

    PutPlayerInVehicle(playerid, vehicleid, 0);

    SendClientMessage(playerid, 0x66CC00FF, "\xCE\xF2\xEB\xE8\xF7\xED\xEE! \xD2\xE5\xEE\xF0\xE5\xF2\xE8\xF7\xE5\xF1\xEA\xE0\xFF \xF7\xE0\xF1\xF2\xFC \xEF\xF0\xEE\xE9\xE4\xE5\xED\xE0. \xD2\xE5\xEF\xE5\xF0\xFC \xED\xE0\xF7\xE8\xED\xE0\xE5\xF2\xF1\xFF \xEF\xF0\xE0\xEA\xF2\xE8\xF7\xE5\xF1\xEA\xE0\xFF \xF7\xE0\xF1\xF2\xFC.");
    SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFFFF00FF, "\xD1\xEB\xE5\xE4\xF3\xE9\xF2\xE5 \xEF\xEE \xEC\xE0\xF0\xF8\xF0\xF3\xF2\xF3 \xE8 \xF1\xEE\xE1\xEB\xFE\xE4\xE0\xE9\xF2\xE5 \xCF\xC4\xC4. \xC4\xD2\xCF \xE8 \xE2\xFB\xF5\xEE\xE4 \xE8\xE7 \xF3\xF7\xE5\xE1\xED\xEE\xE3\xEE \xE0\xE2\xF2\xEE\xEC\xEE\xE1\xE8\xEB\xFF \xEF\xF0\xE8\xE2\xE5\xE4\xF3\xF2 \xEA \xEF\xF0\xEE\xE2\xE0\xEB\xF3.");

    
    SetTimerEx("DV_StartPracticalRoute", 500, false, "i", playerid);
    SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_exam_timer",
        SetTimerEx("DV_PracticalTimeout", 900000, false, "i", playerid)
    );

    return 1;
}

public DV_StartPracticalRoute(playerid)
{
    if(!GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_active")) return 1;
    new vehicleid = GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_vehicle");

    if(vehicleid == INVALID_VEHICLE_ID || !IsPlayerInVehicle(playerid, vehicleid))
    {
        return 1;
    }

    if(GetPlayerDrivingExamInfo(playerid, DE_ROUTE_STEP) == 0)
        NextDrivingExamRouteCP(playerid);

    return 1;
}

public DV_PracticalTimeout(playerid)
{
    if(!GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_active")) return 1;

    new vehicleid = GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_vehicle");
    if(vehicleid != INVALID_VEHICLE_ID)
        SetVehicleToRespawn(vehicleid);

    DisablePlayerRaceCheckpoint(playerid);
    SetPlayerData(playerid, P_DRIVING_LIC, 0);
    ClearPlayerDrivingExamInfo(playerid);

    DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_practical_active");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_practical_category");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_practical_vehicle");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_selected_category");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "car_damage");
    DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_exam_timer");

    Dialog
    (
        playerid, INVALID_DIALOG_ID, DIALOG_STYLE_MSGBOX,
        "\xDD\xEA\xE7\xE0\xEC\xE5\xED \xEF\xF0\xEE\xE2\xE0\xEB\xE5\xED",
        "\xC2\xF0\xE5\xEC\xFF \xEF\xF0\xE0\xEA\xF2\xE8\xF7\xE5\xF1\xEA\xEE\xE3\xEE \xFD\xEA\xE7\xE0\xEC\xE5\xED\xE0 \xE8\xF1\xF2\xE5\xEA\xEB\xEE.\n\n\xCF\xEE\xEF\xF0\xEE\xE1\xF3\xE9\xF2\xE5 \xE5\xF9\xB8 \xF0\xE0\xE7 \xE8 \xE2\xED\xE8\xEC\xE0\xF2\xE5\xEB\xFC\xED\xE5\xE5 \xF1\xEB\xE5\xE4\xE8\xF2\xE5 \xE7\xE0 \xEC\xE0\xF0\xF8\xF0\xF3\xF2\xEE\xEC.",
        "\xCE\xEA", ""
    );
    return 1;
}

stock DV_FinishExam(playerid)
{
    new catIndex = g_DVExamCategory[playerid];
    new bool:passed = bool:(g_DVExamCorrect[playerid] >= DV_EXAM_PASS_SCORE);

    DV_StopTimers(playerid);

    new Node:json = JSON_Object();
    JSON_SetInt(json, "t", 4);
    JSON_SetInt(json, "s", _:passed);
    JSON_SetInt(json, "cq", g_DVExamCorrect[playerid]);
    JSON_SetInt(json, "n", DV_EXAM_LENGTH);
    SendPacketToClient(playerid, GUIDrivingSchool, json);
    JSON_Cleanup(json);

    if(passed)
    {
        
        SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_theory_passed", 1);

        new fmt_text[180];
        format(fmt_text, sizeof fmt_text,
            "\xD2\xE5\xEE\xF0\xE8\xFF \xF3\xF1\xEF\xE5\xF8\xED\xEE \xF1\xE4\xE0\xED\xE0: %d/%d. \xD2\xE5\xEF\xE5\xF0\xFC \xEF\xE5\xF0\xE5\xE9\xE4\xE8\xF2\xE5 \xEA \xEF\xF0\xE0\xEA\xF2\xE8\xF7\xE5\xF1\xEA\xEE\xE9 \xF7\xE0\xF1\xF2\xE8.",
            g_DVExamCorrect[playerid], DV_EXAM_LENGTH);
        ShowNotificationNew(playerid, 3, 6, 0, 0, fmt_text, "qq");

        g_DVExamActive[playerid] = 0;

        
        SetTimerEx("DV_StartPracticalDelayed", 10000, false, "i", playerid);
    }
    else
    {
        new fmt_text[180];
        format(fmt_text, sizeof fmt_text,
            "\xDD\xEA\xE7\xE0\xEC\xE5\xED \xED\xE5 \xF1\xE4\xE0\xED: %d/%d. \xC4\xEB\xFF \xF1\xE4\xE0\xF7\xE8 \xED\xE5\xEE\xE1\xF5\xEE\xE4\xE8\xEC\xEE \xEC\xE8\xED\xE8\xEC\xF3\xEC %d \xEF\xF0\xE0\xE2\xE8\xEB\xFC\xED\xFB\xF5 \xEE\xF2\xE2\xE5\xF2\xEE\xE2.",
            g_DVExamCorrect[playerid], DV_EXAM_LENGTH, DV_EXAM_PASS_SCORE);
        ShowNotificationNew(playerid, 2, 6, 0, 0, fmt_text, "qq");

        g_DVExamActive[playerid] = 0;
        DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_selected_category");
        DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_theory_passed");
    }
    return 1;
}

public DV_TheoryTimeout(playerid)
{
	if(!g_DVExamActive[playerid]) return 1;

	g_DVExamActive[playerid] = 0;
	DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_exam_timer");
	DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_selected_category");
	DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_theory_passed");

	new Node:json = JSON_Object();
	JSON_SetInt(json, "t", 4);
	JSON_SetInt(json, "s", 0);
	JSON_SetInt(json, "cq", g_DVExamCorrect[playerid]);
	JSON_SetInt(json, "n", DV_EXAM_LENGTH);
	SendPacketToClient(playerid, GUIDrivingSchool, json);
	JSON_Cleanup(json);

	SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF6600FF,
		"\xD0\xE5\xE7\xF3\xEB\xFC\xF2\xE0\xF2: \xE2\xF0\xE5\xEC\xFF \xF2\xE5\xEE\xF0\xE8\xE8 \xE8\xF1\xF2\xE5\xEA\xEB\xEE.");
	return 1;
}

public DV_StartPracticalDelayed(playerid)
{
    if(!IsPlayerLogged(playerid)) return 1;
    if(!GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_theory_passed")) return 1;
    if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_active")) return 1;

    DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_theory_passed");
    if(!DV_StartPractical(playerid))
    {
        DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_selected_category");
        SendClientMessage(playerid, 0xFF6600FF, "\xCD\xE5 \xF3\xE4\xE0\xEB\xEE\xF1\xFC \xF1\xEE\xE7\xE4\xE0\xF2\xFC \xF3\xF7\xE5\xE1\xED\xFB\xE9 \xE0\xE2\xF2\xEE\xEC\xEE\xE1\xE8\xEB\xFC. \xCE\xE1\xF0\xE0\xF2\xE8\xF2\xE5\xF1\xFC \xEA \xE0\xE4\xEC\xE8\xED\xE8\xF1\xF2\xF0\xE0\xF6\xE8\xE8.");
    }
    return 1;
}

stock HandlePacketDV(playerid, Node:JSONObject)
{
	new t;
	JSON_GetInt(JSONObject, "t", t);

	switch(t)
	{
		case 1: 
		{
			new idx;
			if(!JSON_GetInt(JSONObject, "s", idx)) return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Категория не выбрана");
			if(idx < 0 || idx >= DV_CATEGORY_COUNT) return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Неверная категория");
			if(idx == 4) return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Водный транспорт пока недоступен");

			new status = DV_GetCategoryStatus(playerid, idx);
			switch(status)
			{
				case DV_STATUS_BLOCKED:  return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Сначала получите предыдущую категорию");
				case DV_STATUS_OWNED:    return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "У вас уже есть эта категория");
				case DV_STATUS_NO_MONEY: return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Недостаточно средств");
			}

			SetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_selected_category", idx);
			ShowDrivingSchoolGUI(playerid);
		}

		case 2: 
		{
			new idx;
			if(!JSON_GetInt(JSONObject, "s", idx))
				idx = GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_selected_category");

			if(idx < 0 || idx >= DV_CATEGORY_COUNT) return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Выберите категорию");
			if(idx == 4) return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Водный транспорт пока недоступен");
			if(bool:g_DVExamActive[playerid]) return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Экзамен уже идёт");

			new status = DV_GetCategoryStatus(playerid, idx);
			switch(status)
			{
				case DV_STATUS_BLOCKED:  return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Сначала получите предыдущую категорию");
				case DV_STATUS_OWNED:    return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "У вас уже есть эта категория");
				case DV_STATUS_NO_MONEY: return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Недостаточно средств");
			}

			new fmt_text[96];
			format(fmt_text, sizeof fmt_text, "Оплата обучения в автошколе (Категория %s)", DV_CategoryName[idx]);
			GivePlayerMoneyEx(playerid, -DV_CategoryPrice[idx], fmt_text, true, false);

			DV_StartExam(playerid, idx);
		}

		case 3: 
		{
			if(!bool:g_DVExamActive[playerid]) return DV_RejectSelection(playerid, "Экзамен не начат");

			new answer;
			JSON_GetInt(JSONObject, "s", answer);

			new qidx = g_DVExamOrder[playerid][g_DVExamProgress[playerid]];
			if(answer == DV_QCorrect[qidx]) g_DVExamCorrect[playerid]++;

			g_DVExamProgress[playerid]++;

			if(g_DVExamProgress[playerid] >= DV_EXAM_LENGTH)
			{
				DV_FinishExam(playerid);
			}
			else
			{
				DV_SendQuestion(playerid);
			}
		}

		case 4: 
		{
			g_DVExamActive[playerid] = 0;

			if(GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_theory_passed") && !GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_active"))
			{
				DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_theory_passed");
				DV_StartPractical(playerid);
			}
			else if(!GetPVarInt(playerid, "dv_practical_active"))
			{
				DeletePVar(playerid, "dv_selected_category");
			}
		}

		default:
		{
			printf("[HandlePacketDV] Unknown type: %d", t);
		}
	}

	return 1;
}

CMD:dv(playerid)
{
	if(!IsPlayerLogged(playerid)) return 1;
	ShowDrivingSchoolGUI(playerid);
	return 1;
}

CMD:testdv(playerid)
{
	printf("[DV-DEBUG] /testdv used by player=%d (logged=%d)", playerid, _:IsPlayerLogged(playerid));
	ShowDrivingSchoolGUI(playerid);
	SendClientMessage(playerid, -1, "{FFFF00}[DV] Открыл меню автошколы напрямую (без проверки NPC), смотри консоль сервера.");
	return 1;
}

new gPlayerUpdateHeavyTick[MAX_PLAYERS];

public OnPlayerUpdate(playerid)
{
	new bool:periodic_update = false;
	new periodic_tick = GetTickCount();
	if(periodic_tick - gPlayerUpdateHeavyTick[playerid] >= 250)
	{
		gPlayerUpdateHeavyTick[playerid] = periodic_tick;
		periodic_update = true;
	}

	if(periodic_update && IsPlayerLogged(playerid)) DrivingSchoolInstructor_ProcessPlayer(playerid);


    if(periodic_update)
    {
    
    
    if(IsPlayerLogged(playerid) && GetPlayerState(playerid) == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT)
    {
        new near_org_fleet = -1;
        for(new org_i = 0; org_i < sizeof(g_org_car); org_i++)
        {
            if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_TEAM) != g_org_car[org_i][O_FRAC_ID]) continue;
            if(IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint(playerid, 2.5, g_org_car[org_i][O_PICKUP][0], g_org_car[org_i][O_PICKUP][1], g_org_car[org_i][O_PICKUP][2]))
            {
                near_org_fleet = org_i;
                break;
            }
        }

        new saved_org_fleet = GetPVarInt(playerid, "org_fleet_near");
        if(near_org_fleet >= 0)
        {
            if(saved_org_fleet != near_org_fleet)
            {
                SetPVarInt(playerid, "org_fleet_near", near_org_fleet);
                OrgFleet_ShowPickupMenu(playerid, near_org_fleet);
            }
        }
        else if(saved_org_fleet != -1)
        {
            SetPVarInt(playerid, "org_fleet_near", -1);
        }
    }
    else
    {
        SetPVarInt(playerid, "org_fleet_near", -1);
    }

    }

    if(periodic_update)
    {
        new near_hr = IsPlayerNearHR(playerid);
        new hr_window = GetPVarInt(playerid, "hr_interaction_window");

        if(near_hr && !hr_window)
        {
            ToggleInteractionWindow(playerid, true);
            SetPVarInt(playerid, "hr_interaction_window", 1);
            ShowNotificationLaird(playerid, 5, 4, 0, 0, "\xce\xf2\xe4\xe5\xeb \xea\xe0\xe4\xf0\xee\xe2", "\xc2\xc7\xc0\xc8\xcc\xce\xc4\xc5\xc9\xd1\xd2\xc2\xc8\xdf");
        }
        else if(!near_hr && hr_window)
        {
            ToggleInteractionWindow(playerid, false);
            DeletePVar(playerid, "hr_interaction_window");
        }

        TrafficSystem_ProcessPlayer(playerid);
        ScrapYard_ProcessPlayer(playerid);
    }
	if(periodic_update) FixBugMoneyMinus(playerid);
	SetPlayerData(playerid, P_AFK_TIME, 0);
    if(periodic_update && GetPlayerState(playerid) == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT)
    {
        new near_vehicle = INVALID_VEHICLE_ID;
        if(TrunkTest_GetNearbyPersonalVehicle(playerid, near_vehicle, 4.5))
        {
            new now_tick = GetTickCount();
            new lock_status = GetVehicleParam(near_vehicle, V_LOCK);

            if(lock_status)
            {
                new exit_tick = GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_EXIT_TICK);
                new lock_hint_vehicle = GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_VEHICLE);

                if((exit_tick <= 0 || (now_tick - exit_tick) >= 11000) && (lock_hint_vehicle != near_vehicle || !GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_SHOWN)))
                {
                    ShowNotificationLaird(playerid, 5, 10, 9102, near_vehicle, "Двери автомобиля закрыты", "ОТКРЫТЬ");
                    SetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_SHOWN, 1);
                    SetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_VEHICLE, near_vehicle);
                    SetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_TICK, now_tick);
                }
            }
            else
            {
                DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_SHOWN);
                DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_VEHICLE);
                DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_TICK);
            }

            if(TrunkTest_IsPlayerNearVehicleRear(playerid, near_vehicle, 2.8))
            {
                new exit_trunk_tick = GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_EXIT_TICK);
                new trunk_hint_vehicle = GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_VEHICLE);

                if((exit_trunk_tick <= 0 || (now_tick - exit_trunk_tick) >= 5000) && (trunk_hint_vehicle != near_vehicle || !GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_SHOWN)))
                {
                    ShowNotificationLaird(playerid, 5, 10, 9101, near_vehicle, "Багажник транспорта закрыт", "ОТКРЫТЬ");
                    SetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_SHOWN, 1);
                    SetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_VEHICLE, near_vehicle);
                    SetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_TICK, now_tick);
                }
            }
            else
            {
                DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_SHOWN);
                DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_VEHICLE);
                DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_TICK);
            }
        }
        else if(GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_SHOWN) || GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_SHOWN))
        {
            DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_SHOWN);
            DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_VEHICLE);
            DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_TICK);
            DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_SHOWN);
            DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_VEHICLE);
            DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_TICK);
        }
    }
    else if(periodic_update && (GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_SHOWN) || GetPVarInt(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_SHOWN)))
    {
        DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_SHOWN);
        DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_VEHICLE);
        DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_TRUNKTEST_HINT_TICK);
        DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_SHOWN);
        DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_VEHICLE);
        DeletePVar(playerid, PVAR_CARLOCK_HINT_TICK);
    }

	if(periodic_update)
    {
        new green_zone_id = GetPVarInt(playerid, "player_in_green_zone") - 1;
	    if(green_zone_id >= 0 && green_zone_id < g_green_zones_loaded && g_green_zones[green_zone_id][GZ_NO_WEAPON])
	    {
		if(GetPlayerWeapon(playerid) != 0)
		{
			SetPlayerArmedWeapon(playerid, 0);
		}
	    }
    }
	
	if(periodic_update)
    {
        new string[50];
        new string2[50];
        format(string, sizeof(string), "X%d", Config[sDonPower]);
        format(string2, sizeof(string2), "%d/1000",Iter_Count(Player));
        PlayerTextDrawSetString(playerid, logo_PTD[playerid][0], string);
        PlayerTextDrawSetString(playerid, logo_PTD[playerid][1], string2);
    }
	

	if(IsPlayerDriver(playerid))
	{
		new keys, gas_brake, left_right;

		GetPlayerKeys(playerid, keys, gas_brake, left_right);

		

		new pedal_type = PEDAL_TYPE_NONE;

		if((keys & KEY_SPRINT) && !(keys & KEY_JUMP || keys & KEY_HANDBRAKE))
			pedal_type = PEDAL_TYPE_GAS;

		else if(keys & KEY_JUMP && !(keys & KEY_SPRINT || keys & KEY_HANDBRAKE))
			pedal_type = PEDAL_TYPE_BRAKE;

		player_press_pedal[playerid] = pedal_type;

		new vehicleid = GetPlayerVehicleID(playerid);

        if(vehicleid != INVALID_VEHICLE_ID && IsAOwnableCar(vehicleid))
        {
            new ownable_index = GetVehicleData(vehicleid, V_ACTION_ID);
            if(ownable_index >= 0)
            {
                new Float:v_speed = floatabs(GetVehicleSpeed(vehicleid));
                new bool:auto_lock_enabled = ((GetOwnableCarData(ownable_index, OC_PDVRADAR) & OWNABLE_CAR_PDVRADAR_FLAG_AUTOLOCK_DISABLED) == 0);

                if(auto_lock_enabled && v_speed >= 70.0 && !GetVehicleParam(vehicleid, V_LOCK))
                {
                    if(!GetPVarInt(playerid, "car_autolock_by_speed"))
                    {
                        SetVehicleParam(vehicleid, V_LOCK, VEHICLE_PARAM_ON);
                        SetPVarInt(playerid, "car_autolock_by_speed", 1);
                        ShowNotificationLaird(playerid, 3, 6, 0, 0, "Транспорт был автоматически закрыт", " ");
                        PlayAudioStreamURL(playerid, "vehicle_sound_door.mp3");
                    }
                }
                else if(v_speed < 65.0 || !GetVehicleParam(vehicleid, V_LOCK))
                {
                    DeletePVar(playerid, "car_autolock_by_speed");
                }
            }
        }
	}
	if (periodic_update && gPlayerBlockedPickup[playerid] != -1)
    {
        new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz;
        new Float:x, Float:y, Float:z;

        GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);

        Streamer_GetFloatData(STREAMER_TYPE_PICKUP, gPlayerBlockedPickup[playerid], E_STREAMER_X, x);
        Streamer_GetFloatData(STREAMER_TYPE_PICKUP, gPlayerBlockedPickup[playerid], E_STREAMER_Y, y);
        Streamer_GetFloatData(STREAMER_TYPE_PICKUP, gPlayerBlockedPickup[playerid], E_STREAMER_Z, z);

        if (GetPlayerDistanceFromPoint(playerid, x, y, z) > 2.0)
        {
            gPlayerBlockedPickup[playerid] = -1;
        }
    }

	if(periodic_update && GetPlayerTempJobCheckAnim(playerid))
	{
		new anim_index = GetPlayerAnimationIndex(playerid);


		switch(GetPlayerTempJob(playerid))
		{
			case TEMP_JOB_LOADER:
			{
				if(!GetPlayerSex(playerid))
				{
					if(!(anim_index == 259 || anim_index == 1189 || anim_index == 1224))
					{
						anim_index = -1;
					}
				}
					else
				{
					if(!(anim_index == 259 || anim_index == 260 || anim_index == 1275 || anim_index == 1276 || anim_index == 1289))
					{
						anim_index = -1;
					}
				}

				if(anim_index == -1)
				{
					SetPlayerTempJobCheckAnim(playerid, false);
					SetPlayerTempJobState(playerid, TEMP_JOB_STATE_LOADER_DROP_LOAD);
				}
			}
			case TEMP_JOB_MINER:
			{
				if(GetPlayerTempJobState(playerid) == TEMP_JOB_STATE_MINER_UNLOAD)
				{
					if(!(anim_index == 616 || anim_index == 1189 || anim_index == 1224))
						SetPlayerTempJobState(playerid, TEMP_JOB_STATE_MINER_DROP_LOAD);
				}
			}
			case TEMP_JOB_FACTORY:
			{
				if(!GetPlayerSex(playerid))
				{
					if(!(anim_index == 259 || anim_index == 949 || anim_index == 1189 || anim_index == 1224 || anim_index == 1257 || anim_index == 1269))
					{
						anim_index = -1;
					}
				}
					else
				{
					if(!(anim_index == 259 || anim_index == 1196 || anim_index == 1275 || anim_index == 1276 || anim_index == 1269 || anim_index == 1283))
					{
						anim_index = -1;
					}
				}

				if(anim_index == -1)
				{
					SetPlayerTempJobCheckAnim(playerid, false);
					SetPlayerTempJobState(playerid, TEMP_JOB_STATE_FACTORY_DROP_P);
				}
			}
			case TEMP_JOB_LUMBERJACK:
			{
				if(!(anim_index == 1189 || anim_index == 1224 || anim_index == 260 || anim_index == 1275 || anim_index == 1276))
				{
					anim_index = -1;
				}

				if(anim_index == -1)
					SetPlayerTempJobState(playerid, TEMP_JOB_STATE_LUMBERJACK_DROP);
			}
			default:
			{
				SetPlayerTempJobCheckAnim(playerid, false);
			}
		}
	}

	WeaponShop_ForceClientAmmoReload(playerid);

	if(GetPlayerWeaponState(playerid) == 2) SetPlayerData(playerid, P_WEAPON_RELOADING, false);
	if(GetPlayerWeaponState(playerid) == 3 && !GetPlayerData(playerid, P_WEAPON_RELOADING))
	{
		SetPlayerData(playerid, P_WEAPON_RELOADING, true);

		switch(GetPlayerWeapon(playerid))
		{
			case 22:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COLT) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][0]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[0] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][0] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COLT, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_colt", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COLT));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 0, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COLT) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 23:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SDPISTOL) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][1]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[1] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][1] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SDPISTOL, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_sdpistol", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SDPISTOL));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 1, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SDPISTOL) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 24:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_DEAGLE) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][2]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[2] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][2] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_DEAGLE, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_deagle", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_DEAGLE));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 2, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_DEAGLE) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 25:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SHOTGUN) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][3]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[3] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][3] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SHOTGUN, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_shotgun", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SHOTGUN));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 3, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SHOTGUN) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 29:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MP5) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][4]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[4] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][4] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MP5, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_mp5", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MP5));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 7, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MP5) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 30:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_AK47) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][5]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[5] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][5] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_AK47, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_ak47", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_AK47));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 8, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_AK47) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 31:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_M4) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][6]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[6] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][6] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_M4, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_m4", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_M4));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 9, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_M4) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 34:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SNIPER_RIFLE) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][7]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[7] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][7] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SNIPER_RIFLE, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_sniper_rifle", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SNIPER_RIFLE));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 10, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SNIPER_RIFLE) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 26:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SAWNOFF) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][8]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[8] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][8] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SAWNOFF, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_sawnoff", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SAWNOFF));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 4, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_SAWNOFF) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 27:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COMBAT_SG) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][9]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[9] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][9] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COMBAT_SG, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_combat_sg", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COMBAT_SG));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 5, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_COMBAT_SG) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
			case 28:
			{
				if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MICRO_UZI) < 100)
				{
					g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][10]++;

					if(GetPlayerData(playerid, P_RELOADINGS_COUNT)[10] == 3)
					{
						g_player[playerid][P_RELOADINGS_COUNT][10] = 0;

						AddPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MICRO_UZI, +, 1);
						UpdatePlayerDatabaseInt(playerid, "skill_micro_uzi", GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MICRO_UZI));

						SetPlayerSkillLevel(playerid, 6, GetPlayerData(playerid, P_SKILL_MICRO_UZI) * 10);
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}
	if(periodic_update && IsPlayerConnected(playerid))
	{
		GetPlayerHealth(playerid, g_damage_last_health[playerid]);
		GetPlayerArmour(playerid, g_damage_last_armour[playerid]);
		g_damage_snapshot_valid[playerid] = true;
	}
	return 1;
}

public OnPlayerStreamIn(playerid, forplayerid)
{
	return 1;
}

public OnPlayerStreamOut(playerid, forplayerid)
{
	return 1;
}

public OnVehicleStreamIn(vehicleid, forplayerid)
{
    if(GetVehicleData(vehicleid, V_ACTION_TYPE) == VEHICLE_ACTION_TYPE_ADMIN_CAR) return sc_OnVehicleStreamIn(vehicleid, forplayerid);
	for(new i = 0; i < streamed_players_in_veh_count[vehicleid]; i++)
    {
        if(streamed_players_in_veh_list[vehicleid][i] == forplayerid) return 1;
    }

    
    new idx = streamed_players_in_veh_count[vehicleid];
    streamed_players_in_veh_list[vehicleid][idx] = forplayerid;
    streamed_players_in_veh_count[vehicleid]++;
	UpdateVehicleVisualForPlayer(forplayerid, vehicleid);
    Iter_Add(streamed_players_in_veh[vehicleid], forplayerid);
	Iter_Add(vehicle_in_stream[forplayerid], vehicleid);
	SetTimerEx("ApplyVehicleTuning", 500, false, "dd", forplayerid, vehicleid);
	
	SetTimerEx("ApplyVehicleFirmware", 1500, false, "dd", forplayerid, vehicleid);
	sc_OnVehicleStreamIn(vehicleid, forplayerid);
	return 1;
}

public OnVehicleStreamOut(vehicleid, forplayerid)
{
	sc_OnVehicleStreamIn(vehicleid, forplayerid);
	 for(new i = 0; i < streamed_players_in_veh_count[vehicleid]; i++)
    {
        if(streamed_players_in_veh_list[vehicleid][i] == forplayerid)
        {
            
            for(new j = i; j < streamed_players_in_veh_count[vehicleid]-1; j++)
            {
                streamed_players_in_veh_list[vehicleid][j] = streamed_players_in_veh_list[vehicleid][j+1];
            }
            streamed_players_in_veh_count[vehicleid]--;
            break;
        }
    }
	Iter_Remove(streamed_players_in_veh[vehicleid], forplayerid);
	Iter_Remove(vehicle_in_stream[forplayerid], vehicleid);
	return 1;
}

